\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kollegnachschriften}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Jakob Anton Kylian}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24, wohl aus Olm\u252 \'fctz. Latein. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus de Jure & Justitia. Pars I. De Jure. Praeter varias juris acceptiones duplex huc pertinet prima juris directivi, quod idem est ac lex, seu regula et mensura operationum humanarum praesestim earum, qvae sunt ad alterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24. 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Inhaltsverzeichnis gem\u228 \'e4\u223 \'df den angef\u252 \'fchrten Randnummern. 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nil volui sensu perversa scribere. Verum / Ad mentem Ecclesiae cuncta sonare volo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Kylian, Jakob Anton: vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 M I 177}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20.}
